# Internal planning docs — keep out of the public repo
*_STRATEGY.md
STRATEGY.md
docs/STRATEGY.md
PRODUCT_ROADMAP.md
docs/PRICING.md
docs/GTM.md
docs/SALES_MOTION.md
docs/VC_ATTACK_SURFACE.md
docs/PLATFORM_STRATEGY.md
